./docs/evidence/art-webp/native-review-chg0058.log:docs/evidence/light-axis/native-review.log: **Application rule:** `lib/icon-map.json` is the machine-readable copy of I01–I12; `components/Story.tsx` renders the eleven used kit icons by these IDs from `/art/icon-kit/NN.png`. It renders connector-only and divider-only source layers separately, so an old extracted icon cannot remain underneath a kit icon. The kit source files are preserved at their supplied paths; public copies must match their SHA-256 hashes. All icon images are decorative (`alt=""`, `aria-hidden`) beside live localized labels and do not intercept pointer input.
